    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-σπασμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rapid respiration</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.5.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
				<i>trailing</i>, of a serpent, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				160
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>.
				<i>inducement</i> (to inference), <i>hint</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1055.13F.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>. <i>traction</i> of the
			foetus, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>.
			<i>suction</i> of cupping instruments, ib.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
